<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank allots 12.63 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank allots 12.63 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 12.63 billion schillings in one-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed 3.0 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The central bank said 16 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allocated 12.19 billion schillings in repos, or 13 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
